        A2[Omni Worker 2 / AsyncOmni / GPU]
    end
    subgraph B[Pool B / H3 Ref2VA]
        B1[Omni Worker 1 / AsyncOmni / GPU]
        B2[Omni Worker 2 / AsyncOmni / GPU]
    end
    subgraph S[Pool C / 可选独立超分池]
        S1[复合 Omni Worker / H3 / GPU] --> S2[受管 SeedVR2 服务 / GPU]
    end
    E[(etcd 集群 / HA 示例 3 成员)]
    F[(共享制品文件系统 / 同一根目录)]
    O[Prometheus → Grafana]
    R <-.->|任务、幂等、队列、owner、slot、重试记账| E
    A1 & A2 & B1 & B2 & S1 -.->|Runtime 注册发现| E
